GhostVidStream Alpine Pi appliance (decode-only → HDMI)

- HDMI kiosk: ghostvidstream (SDL2 KMSDRM), auto-hide chrome
- LAN settings: http://<this-host>:8080/
- SSH: disabled by default (key-only policy if you enable sshd)
- No encoders / publishers / full desktop

Config: /etc/ghostvidstream/config
Profiles: /etc/ghostvidstream/profiles/ (Pi 3B+ → bandwidth=lowest)
